*.idea/
*.DS_Store

# Cloudflare Pages rejects any file over 25 MiB and FAILS THE WHOLE BUILD.
# TIFFs are camera/source originals, unusable in a browser, and routinely 29MB.
# Convert to JPEG before committing. (Incident 2026-08-13: four 29MB .tif files
# broke every deploy repo-wide for ~9h, blocking a live flash-sale fix.)
*.tif
*.tiff
*.TIF
*.TIFF
